on exitFrame
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 14 ........................... <the mouseDown>
  [  4] jmpifz [ 24] ............................ if the mouseDown then
  [  7] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  9] thebuiltin 14 ........................... <the mouseDown>
  [ 11] jmpifz [ 20] ............................ repeat while the mouseDown
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 16] extcall 27 .............................. nothing()
  [ 18] endrepeat [  7]
  [ 20] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 22] extcall 28 .............................. quit()
  [ 24] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 26] thebuiltin 16 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 28] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 30] extcall 15 .............................. go(the frame)
  [ 32] ret
end
